silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_05_probe_ungated_render_concrete_anchor_5#rendereddiagramproofsurface silm:hasLongDescription "The RenderedDiagramProofSurface is RenderedDiagram is the terminal node of the R5 pipeline. For the Mittens fixture, the proof-surface figure renders the MeasurementEvent2024 claim with the labelled box \"Mittens, body mass 4.1kg, 2024-11-01\" connected by the typed measurement arrow into the Mittens cocone. Critically, this is the proof-surface form of the figure: every box in it is backed by a ValidatedClaim. A schematic figure with the same labels but no ValidatedClaim backing is a different object and lives outside R5." .
